{"id":396,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"They live in the fields and mountains, gathering in large flocks. Their cries are quite obnoxious. Though small, their wings are strong—a strike from them leaves pain that persists for a week."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Diamond"],"text":"They flock in great numbers. Though small, they flap their wings with great power."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"Usually with a large flock, it is barely noticeable when alone. Its cries are very strident."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Keen Eye","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered."},{"name":"Reckless","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up moves that have recoil damage."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Brown","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":396,"name":"Starly","condition":null,"children":[{"id":397,"name":"Staravia","condition":"Lv. 14","children":[{"id":398,"name":"Staraptor","condition":"Lv. 34","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[5,98],[9,17],[13,104],[17,283],[21,18],[25,332],[29,36],[33,97],[37,413],[41,515]],"machine":[512,332,97,314,403,413,38,814,283,203,263,297,19,257,270,542,182,240,156,214,164,241,129,366,36,851,168,369,253],"egg":[310,38,297,31,28,253],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv1-221","name":"Starly","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"221","artist":"saino misaki","img":"sv1/221"},{"id":"me2pt5-168","name":"Larry's Starly","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Common","n